            <ArticleTitle>A rare cause for knee pain: fracture of the femoral component after TKR. A case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>756-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the rare case of sudden knee pain due to fracture of the total knee replacement nine years after implantation. Fracture occurred because of subsequent osteolysis due to polyethylene wear.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
